{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"santizhu059-e-sr-psz-nianlu","title":"裴松之驳《江表传》奋禁锢年数","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu059-a-be4c963ecf0c4294a138","label":"裴松之按语","text":"臣松之按：建衡二年至奋之死孙皓即位未久，儿女年岁与禁锢年数不合；欲增皓之恶然非实理","evidence":["santizhu059-q-36621547c4950e420ac4"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0003","role":"驳《江表传》所记年数非实理","evidence":["santizhu059-q-36621547c4950e420ac4"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu059-q-36621547c4950e420ac4"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu059-q-36621547c4950e420ac4","source_order":[59,292,0],"order":10502}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0003","name":"裴松之","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"santizhu059-q-36621547c4950e420ac4","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-cb95a753c1ebdc4e5cd9","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按：建衡二年至奋之死，孙皓即位尚犹未久。若奋未被疑之前，儿女年二十左右，至奋死时，不得年三十、四十也。若先已长大，自失时未婚娶，则不由皓之禁锢矣。此虽欲增皓之恶，然非实理。","attribution":"裴松之按语","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":291,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ee9efd39c32bb0fb3022","start":0,"end":89,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
